theorem k215UnpairAt4737Reach16 (a b n c: nat): $ k215PReach (k215UnpairAt4737State k215PNum4744 a b n c) (k215UnpairAt4737State k215PNum4737 a b n c) $ = '(k215PReach_step k215UnpairAt4737Step16);

theorem k215UnpairAt4737CycleZero (b n c: nat): $ k215PReach (k215UnpairAt4737State k215PNum4737 0 b (suc n) c) (k215UnpairAt4737State k215PNum4737 (suc b) 0 n c) $ = '(ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt4737Reach9S) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt4737Reach10) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt4737Reach11Z) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt4737ReachTransfer) k215UnpairAt4737Reach16))));
