 '(eqtr (addeq1 fstsnd) addSass);
theorem k215UnpairAt4737RunInductive (n a b c: nat): $ k215UnpairAt4737Claim n c -> k215UnpairAt4737Run (suc n) a b c $ =
 '(syl (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt4737Advance)
   (mpbid (a1i (k215PReacheq2 (k215UnpairAt4737Stateeq eqid
